{"title":"毛主席的革命文艺路线胜利万岁","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1970,"month":12,"day":25}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"东海红,李玉和"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天天磨刀　来者必歼"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驻沪海军航空兵某部"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上海美术学校工农兵美术创作班学员"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"实现无产阶级教育革命必须有工人阶级领导"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上海美术学校工农兵美术创作班学员"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用毛泽东思想武装起来的人是最大的战斗力"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驻沪海军航空兵某部　东海红"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸怀朝阳何所惧　敢将青春献人民　江西余江县插队落户上海知识青年"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}